e Xiakou area. He was later caught in a night raid by Jin forces and was cut down from his horse by the Jin officer Zhou Zhi.","jp":"呉の武将、驃騎将軍。晋による呉征伐を防ぐ際、呉の都督を務め、夏口一帯で晋の大将・杜預の進攻を迎撃した。後に晋軍の夜襲を受け、晋将・周旨に馬上で討ち取られた。","kr":"오나라의 무장이자 표기장군이다. 진나라 군대의 오나라 침공을 방어할 당시 오나라의 도독을 맡아 하구 일대에서 진나라 대장 두예의 공격을 막아냈다. 이후 진군의 야습을 받아 진나라 장수 주지에게 말 위에서 베였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10722","remark":"","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"歆","nameTc":"歆","nameEn":"Xin","nameJp":"歆","nameKr":"흠","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"孙歆","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"249","city":"CS1057","gender":"0","rule":"68","force":"70","wise":"34","politics":"42","charm":"63","will":"68","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"21/67/21/21/21/8/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1011605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4600","battleSoulPoint":"4900","debateSoulPoint":"1100","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/1/0/1/0/3/1/0/0/0/0/0/1/1/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/2/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"78","loyalty":"0","reputation":"950","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"235","show":"249","death":"280","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1019605","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;18/1;25/1;10/1;3/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo